OL,3,GNEWSACould retexturing roads save money
OL,4,Aand make them safer?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is deploying a new method of
OL,7,Frestoring roads and is hoping to make
OL,8,Fthem safer for drivers.
OL,10,FRetexturing strips away built-up grime
OL,11,Fto expose the stone beneath and improve
OL,12,Fgrip for a fraction of the materials,
OL,13,Fenergy and cost resurfacing needs.
OL,15,FThe method, which is already used by
OL,16,Fcouncils in Berkshire and Dorset, is
OL,17,Fnow being trialled by Wokingham Borough
OL,18,FCouncil for the first time.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
