OL,3,GNEWSACould retexturing roads save money
OL,4,Aand make them safer?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is one of five treatments the
OL,7,Fcouncil uses to maintain its roads and
OL,8,Ffootways and the authority says it's a
OL,9,Fway of making its limited budget go
OL,10,Ffurther.
